  "content": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 750px; margin: auto; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 10px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #007bff, #0056b3);\"></div><div style=\"padding: 30px 40px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\"><img src=\"{{school_logo_url}}\" style=\"height: 70px; margin-right: 20px;\"><div style=\"flex-grow: 1;\"><h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: #0056b3;\">{{school_name}}</h1><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555;\">{{school_address}}</p></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\"><h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; color: #333; letter-spacing: 1px;\">BONAFIDE CERTIFICATE</h2><hr style=\"width: 80px; border: 1.5px solid #007bff; margin: 10px auto;\"></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\"><p>This is to certify that <strong>{{student_name}}</strong> is a bonafide student of our school, studying in <strong>Class {{class_section}}</strong> for the academic year <strong>{{academic_session}}</strong>.</p><p>His/her Admission Number is <strong>{{admission_no}}</strong> and his/her date of birth as per our school records is <strong>{{dob}}</strong>.</p><p>We confirm that he/she has shown good conduct and character during his/her tenure at the school.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 70px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #777;\"><strong>Date of Issue:</strong> {{current_date}}</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"{{student_photo_url}}\" style=\"height: 45px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 5px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\">Principal's Signature</p></div></div></div></div>",
